diff --git a/apps/desktop/README.md b/apps/desktop/README.md
index f59840e5..7505ad62 100644
--- a/apps/desktop/README.md
+++ b/apps/desktop/README.md
@@ -248,6 +248,12 @@ Use the dedicated guides for build and release operations. Shared Windows runner
 
 <a id="windows-installer-interface"></a>
 
+### Local Ubuntu builds
+
+On Linux x64, `pnpm run package:linux:x64` builds a local `.deb` with its own Node, Python and pnpm runtimes. Install the package with Ubuntu's package manager, then open DeepSeek Harness from the application launcher. Set `DSH_DESKTOP_LINUX_UPDATE_URL` to the HTTPS directory that publishes `stable-linux.yml` and its `.deb` before packaging to enable the existing in-app update flow. The updater checks SHA-512, refuses downgrades, and asks for installation through the desktop update dialog; Ubuntu may require administrator authentication. Builds without this setting have no online update source. `pnpm run test:updates:linux` qualifies the real Debian updater without installing software after runtime preparation.
+
+The Linux Host and installed CLI use the bundled standalone Node and external `resources/dsh` tree because Electron's Linux GLib symbols can crash sharp. Closing a Linux workspace minimizes it so GNOME users can restore it from the Dock even without a tray extension. The application also exposes a tray menu when the desktop supports one. The desktop entry enables Wayland input-method support. Manage dsh Command installs into `~/.local/bin`; that directory must be on the user's PATH.
+
 ## Windows installer interface
 
 The Windows installer uses native NSIS pages with light and dark palettes, system shadows, an editable installation directory, and a finish page whose launch checkbox is selected by default. Installation is restricted to the current user. Clicking Install or pressing Enter validates the current path; drive roots remain invalid after normalization, including repeated trailing separators. New destinations must be empty, and nonempty destinations must be registered installations. Running executables at the affected installation path produce a native prompt and remain running; same-named applications in other directories do not block installation. Silent updates wait up to ten seconds for the affected application to exit, then stop with exit code 2 if it is still running.
diff --git a/apps/desktop/README.zh.md b/apps/desktop/README.zh.md
index 62e19b7e..dc32c4d2 100644
--- a/apps/desktop/README.zh.md
+++ b/apps/desktop/README.zh.md
@@ -248,6 +248,12 @@ Desktop 在 Host 启动后、打开工作区前检查模型 API Key 引用是否
 
 <a id="windows-installer-interface"></a>
 
+### 本地 Ubuntu 构建
+
+在 Linux x64 上，`pnpm run package:linux:x64` 构建自带 Node、Python 和 pnpm 运行时的本地 `.deb`。使用 Ubuntu 包管理器安装后，从应用启动器打开 DeepSeek Harness。打包前将 `DSH_DESKTOP_LINUX_UPDATE_URL` 设为提供 `stable-linux.yml` 及 `.deb` 的 HTTPS 目录，即可启用现有客户端更新流程。更新器校验 SHA-512、拒绝降级，并通过桌面更新对话框确认安装；Ubuntu 可能要求管理员认证。未配置该变量的构建没有在线更新源。准备运行时后，`pnpm run test:updates:linux` 可验证真实 Debian 更新器，且不安装软件。
+
+Linux 后台和安装后的 CLI 使用内置独立 Node 以及外置 `resources/dsh` 目录，因为 Electron 在 Linux 中的 GLib 符号可能导致 sharp 崩溃。关闭 Linux 工作区会最小化窗口，GNOME 用户无需托盘扩展也能从 Dock 恢复；桌面支持托盘时，应用还提供托盘菜单。桌面入口启用 Wayland 输入法支持。“管理 dsh 命令”将命令安装到 `~/.local/bin`，该目录需要位于用户 PATH 中。
+
 ## Windows 安装界面
 
 Windows 安装程序使用原生 NSIS 页面，提供亮暗配色、系统阴影、可编辑的安装目录，以及默认勾选立即启动的完成页。安装仅面向当前用户。点击安装或按 Enter 均校验当前路径；路径规范化后仍拒绝磁盘根目录，包括带重复末尾分隔符的写法。新安装位置必须为空，非空位置必须是已登记的安装目录。受影响安装路径中的程序运行时显示系统提示，并保持应用运行；其他目录中的同名应用不阻止安装。静默更新最多等待受影响应用退出十秒，若仍在运行则以退出码 2 结束。
diff --git a/apps/desktop/cli/dsh-linux b/apps/desktop/cli/dsh-linux
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..3bf6ae50
--- /dev/null
+++ b/apps/desktop/cli/dsh-linux
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+#!/bin/sh
+# Run the installed CLI without changing the invoking shell or working directory.
+set -e
+launcher=$0
+while [ -L "$launcher" ]; do
+  directory=$(CDPATH= cd -- "$(dirname -- "$launcher")" && pwd -P)
+  target=$(readlink "$launcher")
+  case "$target" in
+    /*) launcher=$target ;;
+    *) launcher=$directory/$target ;;
+  esac
+done
+resources=$(CDPATH= cd -- "$(dirname -- "$launcher")/../../.." && pwd -P)
+exec "$resources/runtime/primary-runtime/dependencies/node/bin/node" --expose-internals "$resources/dsh/node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh-desktop-host/lib/cli.js" "$@"
